description:
Implement --format json for programmatic consumption:

JSON structure:
{
  'nodes': [
    {
      'id': 'full-uuid',
      'short_id': '8-char',
      'title': 'Issue title',
      'type': 'bug|ux|usecase|...',
      'status': 'todo|in_progress|done|blocked',
      'x': float,  // layer position
      'y': float,  // position within layer
      'in_critical_path': bool  // if --goal specified
    }
  ],
  'edges': [
    {'source': 'uuid', 'target': 'uuid', 'type': 'required_for|scheduled_before'}
  ],
  'layout': {
    'width': float,
    'height': float,
    'layers': int
  }
}

Document schema in docs/flow-json-schema.md
Use for integration with external tools (web frontends, analysis tools)
